<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT>
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    skos:altLabel "DICT"@en ;
    skos:definition "User Defined Groups and Headings"@en ;
    skos:historyNote """Group status: Required in all files which include user defined groups and/or headings (Rule 18)
AGS 4.1: Group Rule Added - • If the DICT_TYPE is HEADING, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP, DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_UNIT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_DESC. • If the DICT_TYPE is GROUP, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP and DICT_DESC and the DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_UNIT headings shall contain NULL values. • Data type for data field heading DICT_UNIT shall not be changed from PU.""" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    skos:narrower
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_DESC> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_DTYP> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_EXMP> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_GRP> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_HDNG> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_PGRP> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_REM> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_STAT> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_TYPE> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/DICT_UNIT> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FILE_FSET> ;
    skos:notation "DICT"^^xsd:token ;
    skos:prefLabel "User Defined Groups and Headings"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote
        """DICT is required in all AGS4 files where user defined groups and/or headings are specified (Rule 18).
DICT_STAT defines the status of the heading. This shall contain the data 'KEY', 'REQUIRED', 'KEY+REQUIRED' or 'OTHER', where OTHER denotes the data field is neither key nor required (Rule 10).
DICT_PGRP allows for inclusion of the parent group name when the DICT_TYPE is "GROUP". This permits data integrity checking where data files include user defined groups."""@en ,
        """Group rules: If the DICT_TYPE is HEADING, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP, DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_UNIT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_DESC.
If the DICT_TYPE is GROUP, there shall be data variables present for DICT_GRP and DICT_DESC and the DICT_HDNG, DICT_STAT, DICT_DTYP and DICT_UNIT headings shall contain NULL values.
Data type for data field heading DICT_UNIT shall not be changed from PU."""@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://gitlab.com/AGS-DFWG-Web/ASG4/-/blob/710b1f08097264e6508be1397282aece79278fc4/AGS4/AGS4_2/4_2_0/groupsandheadings4-2-0.json> ;
    schema:status status:stable ;
    agso:groupClass ags:DICT ;
.

<https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHI>
    a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    skos:altLabel "FGHI"@en ;
    skos:definition "Field Geohydraulic Testing - Instrumentation Details"@en ;
    skos:historyNote """Group status: New
AGS 4.1: Group Added - Replaces IPRG and IPRT
AGS 4.1: Headings Added - LOCA_ID, FGHG_TOP, FGHG_BASE, FGHG_TESN, FGHI_INST, FGHI_TYPE, FGHI_DETL, FGHI_LOCT, FGHI_REM, FILE_FSET""" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    skos:narrower
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHG_BASE> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHG_TESN> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHG_TOP> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHI_DETL> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHI_INST> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHI_LOCT> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHI_REM> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHI_TYPE> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FILE_FSET> ,
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/LOCA_ID> ;
    skos:notation "FGHI"^^xsd:token ;
    skos:prefLabel "Field Geohydraulic Testing - Instrumentation Details"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote """The FGHI group, together with the FGHT group, allows transfer of test records (readings or measurements) made during the test where this is required in the test specification.
FGHI_INST defines a specific measuring device within the test system by a unique reference. Further information on the type, model, etc can be provided in FGHI_TYPE and FGHI_DETL.
Details of the location/position of the measuring device can be provided in FGHI_LOCT, including depths in relation to the test section defined by FGHG_TOP and FGHG_BASE.
Multiple simultaneous readings in the FGHT group can be accommodated through FGHI_INST, e.g. simultaneous flow and pressure readings at 1 minute intervals, including pressure readings from more than one location within the system."""@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://gitlab.com/AGS-DFWG-Web/ASG4/-/blob/710b1f08097264e6508be1397282aece79278fc4/AGS4/AGS4_2/4_2_0/groupsandheadings4-2-0.json> ;
    schema:status status:stable ;
    agso:groupClass ags:FGHI ;
    agso:parentGroup <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHG> ;
.

