    skos:prefLabel "In Situ California Bearing Ratio Tests"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote """ICBR_TYPE allows a description or abbreviation to be included to categorise the equipment and method of measurement.
ICBR_SEAT allows the plunger seating force to be included in the data as required.
ICBR_SURC allows the surcharge pressure to be recorded and the description for the ICBR_REM heading has been modified.
ICBR_CONT allows the name of a specialist sub-contracting organization to be credited with the testing."""@en ;
