    skos:notation "MONG"^^xsd:token ;
    skos:prefLabel "Monitoring Installations and Instruments"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote """Each monitoring point should have a unique identification detailed in MONG_ID. Typically this reflects the actual reference or marking on the instrument.
MONG_DETL should be used to describe the instrument/sensor location or parameter in specific terms.
MONG_CONT used to include details of which organization installed the monitoring device.
PIPE_REF is to be used to link the monitoring installation with the appropriate pipe within an installation (for example where there is both a shallow and a deep installation)."""@en ;
