    skos:altLabel "FGHG"@en ;
    skos:definition "Field Geohydraulic Testing - General"@en ;
    skos:historyNote """Group status: New
AGS 4.1: Group Added - Replaces IPRG and IPRT
AGS 4.1: Headings Added - LOCA_ID, FGHG_TOP, FGHG_BASE, FGHG_TESN, FGHG_TDIA, FGHG_SDIA, FGHG_ODIA, FGHG_HBAS, FGHG_CAS, FGHG_SFAC, FGHG_SFRF, FGHG_DATE, FGHG_TYPE, FGHG_CNFG, FGHG_METH, FGHG_PRWL, FGHG_AWL, FGHG_HEAD, FGHG_FLOW, FGHG_IPRM, FGHG_ILUG, FGHG_FTYP, FGHG_REM, FGHG_ENV, FGHG_CONT, FGHG_OPER, FGHG_CRED, TEST_STAT, FILE_FSET""" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary> ;
    skos:narrower
        <https://w3id.org/ags4/voc/dictionary/FGHG_AWL> ,
